---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';

const allNetworks = await getCollection('networks');
const glg = allNetworks.find(n => n.data.slug === 'glg')!;
const alpha = allNetworks.find(n => n.data.slug === 'alphasights')!;

const comparisons = [
  { label: 'Founded', glg: String(glg.data.founded), alpha: String(alpha.data.founded) },
  { label: 'Headquarters', glg: glg.data.headquarters, alpha: alpha.data.headquarters },
  { label: 'Expert Network Size', glg: glg.data.expertCount, alpha: alpha.data.expertCount },
  { label: 'Employees', glg: glg.data.employeeCount, alpha: alpha.data.employeeCount },
  { label: 'Pricing Model', glg: glg.data.pricingModel, alpha: alpha.data.pricingModel },
  { label: 'Pricing Detail', glg: glg.data.pricingDetail || 'N/A', alpha: alpha.data.pricingDetail || 'N/A' },
  { label: 'Delivery Model', glg: glg.data.deliveryModel || 'Concierge', alpha: alpha.data.deliveryModel || 'Concierge' },
  { label: 'Category', glg: glg.data.categoryBadge || 'Global Leader', alpha: alpha.data.categoryBadge || 'Global Leader' },
  { label: 'Region Strength', glg: glg.data.regionStrength || 'Global', alpha: alpha.data.regionStrength || 'Global' },
  { label: 'AI Badge', glg: glg.data.aiBadge || 'N/A', alpha: alpha.data.aiBadge || 'N/A' },
  { label: 'Compliance', glg: glg.data.complianceBadge || 'Strong Compliance', alpha: alpha.data.complianceBadge || 'Strong Compliance' },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="GLG vs AlphaSights: Complete Comparison (2026) | ExpertNetworks.net"
  description="Head-to-head comparison of GLG and AlphaSights — the two largest expert networks. Compare pricing, expert coverage, AI capabilities, compliance, services, and which is right for your team."
  canonicalPath="/glg-vs-alphasights"
  jsonLd={{
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Article",
    "headline": "GLG vs AlphaSights: Complete Comparison (2026)",
    "description": "Head-to-head comparison of GLG and AlphaSights expert networks across pricing, AI, compliance, and services.",
    "publisher": {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "ExpertNetworks.net",
      "url": "https://expertnetworks.net"
    },
    "datePublished": "2026-03-08",
    "dateModified": "2026-03-08"
  }}
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="pt-32 pb-16 px-6 bg-gradient-to-b from-bg-secondary to-bg-primary">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
        <a href="/what-is-an-expert-network" class="text-accent text-sm font-medium no-underline hover:underline">&larr; What's an Expert Network?</a>
      </div>
      <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-accent/10 text-accent text-xs font-semibold rounded-full mb-4 tracking-wide uppercase">Head-to-Head</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-primary mb-6 leading-tight">
        GLG vs AlphaSights
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-secondary max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
        The industry pioneer vs. the fastest-growing challenger. Here's how they actually compare on the things that matter — pricing, speed, AI, compliance, and product depth.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Visual Face-off -->
  <section class="py-12 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <a href="/networks/glg" class="block no-underline group">
          <div class="rounded-card p-6 text-center border-2 border-transparent hover:border-accent/30 transition-colors" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(26,54,93,0.06), rgba(37,99,235,0.06))">
            {glg.data.logo ? (
              <img src={glg.data.logo} alt="GLG logo" width="64" height="64" class="w-16 h-16 rounded-xl object-cover mx-auto mb-4" loading="lazy" />
            ) : (
              <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-xl mx-auto mb-4" style={`background: linear-gradient(135deg, ${glg.data.gradientFrom}, ${glg.data.gradientTo})`}>G</div>
            )}
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary mb-1 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors">GLG</h2>
            <p class="text-xs text-secondary">Gerson Lehrman Group</p>
            <div class="mt-3 text-2xl font-extrabold text-primary">{glg.data.expertCount}</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-tertiary">experts · est. {glg.data.founded}</div>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="/networks/alphasights" class="block no-underline group">
          <div class="rounded-card p-6 text-center border-2 border-transparent hover:border-accent/30 transition-colors" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(15,118,110,0.06), rgba(20,184,166,0.06))">
            {alpha.data.logo ? (
              <img src={alpha.data.logo} alt="AlphaSights logo" width="64" height="64" class="w-16 h-16 rounded-xl object-cover mx-auto mb-4" loading="lazy" />
            ) : (
              <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-xl mx-auto mb-4" style={`background: linear-gradient(135deg, ${alpha.data.gradientFrom}, ${alpha.data.gradientTo})`}>A</div>
            )}
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary mb-1 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors">AlphaSights</h2>
            <p class="text-xs text-secondary">&nbsp;</p>
            <div class="mt-3 text-2xl font-extrabold text-primary">{alpha.data.expertCount}</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-tertiary">expert relationships · est. {alpha.data.founded}</div>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Comparison Table -->
  <section class="py-12 px-6 bg-bg-secondary">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary mb-6">Side-by-Side Comparison</h2>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-card shadow-card overflow-hidden">
        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full text-sm">
            <thead>
              <tr class="border-b border-border/40">
                <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-tertiary uppercase tracking-wider w-1/3">Metric</th>
                <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider w-1/3" style={`color: ${glg.data.gradientTo}`}>GLG</th>
                <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider w-1/3" style={`color: ${alpha.data.gradientTo}`}>AlphaSights</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              {comparisons.map((row, i) => (
                <tr class={`${i % 2 === 0 ? 'bg-bg-secondary/30' : ''} border-b border-border/20`}>
                  <td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium text-primary text-xs">{row.label}</td>
                  <td class="px-5 py-3 text-secondary text-xs">{row.glg}</td>
                  <td class="px-5 py-3 text-secondary text-xs">{row.alpha}</td>
                </tr>
              ))}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Services Comparison -->
  <section class="py-16 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary mb-8">Products & Services</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-primary mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
            <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-[9px]" style={`background: linear-gradient(135deg, ${glg.data.gradientFrom}, ${glg.data.gradientTo})`}>G</div>
            GLG Services
          </h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            {(glg.data.services || []).map((s: string) => (
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-secondary">
                <svg width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="text-accent-green flex-shrink-0"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                {s}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-primary mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
            <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-[9px]" style={`background: linear-gradient(135deg, ${alpha.data.gradientFrom}, ${alpha.data.gradientTo})`}>A</div>
            AlphaSights Services
          </h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            {(alpha.data.services || []).map((s: string) => (
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-secondary">
                <svg width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="text-accent-green flex-shrink-0"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                {s}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- AI Comparison -->
  <section class="py-16 px-6 bg-bg-secondary">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary mb-8">AI & Technology</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-card p-5 shadow-card">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-primary mb-3">GLG AI Stack</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            {(glg.data.aiCapabilities || []).map((c: string) => (
              <li class="text-sm text-secondary flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-accent-orange mt-0.5">&#9679;</span>
                {c}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-card p-5 shadow-card">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-primary mb-3">AlphaSights AI Stack</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            {(alpha.data.aiCapabilities || []).map((c: string) => (
              <li class="text-sm text-secondary flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-accent-green mt-0.5">&#9679;</span>
                {c}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Key Differentiators -->
  <section class="py-16 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary mb-8">Key Differentiators</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="border border-border/60 rounded-card p-5">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-primary mb-3">Why Choose GLG</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            {(glg.data.keyDifferentiators || []).map((d: string) => (
              <li class="text-sm text-secondary flex items-start gap-2">
                <svg width="12" height="12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                {d}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-border/60 rounded-card p-5">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-primary mb-3">Why Choose AlphaSights</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            {(alpha.data.keyDifferentiators || []).map((d: string) => (
              <li class="text-sm text-secondary flex items-start gap-2">
                <svg width="12" height="12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                {d}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Best For -->
  <section class="py-16 px-6 bg-bg-secondary">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary mb-8">Best For</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-card p-5 shadow-card">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-primary mb-3">GLG Is Best For</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            {(glg.data.bestFor || []).map((b: string) => (
              <li class="text-sm text-secondary">&rarr; {b}</li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-card p-5 shadow-card">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-primary mb-3">AlphaSights Is Best For</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            {(alpha.data.bestFor || []).map((b: string) => (
              <li class="text-sm text-secondary">&rarr; {b}</li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Verdict -->
  <section class="py-16 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary mb-6">The Bottom Line</h2>
      <div class="prose prose-sm text-secondary leading-relaxed max-w-none space-y-4">
        <p>
          <strong>GLG</strong> is the industry's broadest platform. If you need multi-format research (calls + surveys + events + library + placements), global coverage across nearly every sector, and the most established compliance infrastructure in the space, GLG is the default choice for large institutional buyers. The trade-off: it's typically the most expensive option, and the breadth of the platform can feel heavy for teams that just need fast expert calls.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>AlphaSights</strong> positions itself as the speed and service leader. If your team operates under time pressure (PE deal diligence, fast-moving hedge fund research), AlphaSights' custom-sourcing model and high-touch project management are a core part of their value proposition. Their AI investment (AlphaGPT, AlphaGraph) is aggressive and they're growing faster than any peer. The trade-off: narrower product suite than GLG, and the per-call pricing model can add up for high-volume users.
        </p>
        <p>
          Some research teams use both — GLG for breadth and AlphaSights for speed. They're complementary more than they are substitutes.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Related -->
  <section class="py-12 px-6 bg-bg-secondary">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary mb-6">Keep exploring</h2>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href="/compare" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-accent text-white rounded-full font-semibold text-sm no-underline hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors">Full Comparison Tool</a>
        <a href="/best-expert-networks" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-white text-primary border border-border rounded-full font-semibold text-sm no-underline hover:bg-bg-secondary transition-colors">Best Networks Ranked</a>
        <a href="/expert-network-pricing" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-white text-primary border border-border rounded-full font-semibold text-sm no-underline hover:bg-bg-secondary transition-colors">Pricing Guide</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
